      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The incidence of shoulder injuries in the work place has risen significantly over the last 10 years. The purpose of this article is to review the anatomy and examination of the shoulder and to present an approach to treating shoulder disorders commonly seen in the injured worker."},
